  "description": "Intrigue X E+ does it all – climbs like a champ and descends with trail-ready confidence that will take you to the next level. Intrigue X E+ features the top end SyncDrive Pro motor, which offers five levels of assistance and an exclusive Smart Assist mode with 100-360% assistance. Meet all the demands of your terrain with an advanced rear flip chip, allowing you to change the geometry of the bike to be more suitable for climbing or descending, depending on your trail needs. Designed to match you with just the right wheel size for balance and maneuverability, XS frames come with 27.5-inch wheels, while S-L frames come with 29-inch wheels. The 150 mm front / 140 mm rear suspension combined with natural-feeling, seamless power integration allows you to get to the trailhead faster and climb steeper routes, but the real fun begins once you start the downhill!",
